description:
Design a circuit that performs a combined operation of edge detection and bit shifting. On each positive clock edge, it calculates the XOR of the input signal with an internal state to produce an "any edge" output. This output is then shifted through a register, and specific bits are ANDed together to generate a final output. The circuit effectively detects changes in the input and processes these changes through shifting and logical operations, resulting in an 8-bit output that reflects these operations.
